<main><section id="home" class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">NAICTS • FACULTY INFORMATION HUB</span><h1>Know what’s happening. <em>Stay informed.</em></h1><p>Official updates, faculty announcements, PRO communications and events — accessible to everyone.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#news">Explore updates</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#pro">PRO Desk</a></div></div><div class="hero-panel"><img src="/assets/naicts-logo.jpg"><span>Official information</span><strong>One place. Clear updates.</strong><small>School of Information and Communication Technology (SICT)</small></div></section>
<section class="ticker"><b>INFOHUB</b><span>Verified NAICTS and faculty information in one platform.</span><a href="#announcements">View important announcement →</a></section>
